# Slices 276, 277 (CODEX-OPUS-275-MAPS-20261103T214114Z-01, CODEX-OPUS-276-REVIEW-CONSUMER-20261104T024655Z-01; the book, "При последовательных композициях
# соответствия составляются"; the author 2026-10-26: used fields, not the whole interface).  A pair first reached below a mapped holder is composed from the
# records of that value and of that requirement through a middle Model.  Where no such chain exists, the edge being read is the Consumer: Thin has no `extra`,
# Near's nested model has, and only `y` is reached, so nothing refuses.  A used edge the value does not satisfy is the operation's implicit `implements`, and a
# later edge of the same pair is a later use with its own check.  The holder's admission saw Fat in the slot, and Thin stood there only later.
# Entry 7; 81.. name the failing check.
